# Secrets. This package has none today and this line exists so that stays true
# if that ever changes. It must be here BEFORE the first commit, not after.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.tsbuildinfo

# Scaffold leftovers
.vite/
coverage/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The tree-integrity sentinel. checks/mutations.ts writes it before the first
# mutation and removes it only after the restore is VERIFIED byte-identical, so
# one left behind means that run was killed mid-flight and this tree may still
# be carrying its mutation. It is a local runtime artifact, never a deliverable,
# and a committed one would block every clone.
.mutation-sentinel.json
